# CCTV FOOTAGE SUMMARY — CAM10, PAKWAN/PALWAN CROSS ROAD
**Date:** 28-08-2025, 10:30–11:30 (60 minutes)

---

## 1. SCENE
Cam10 overlooks Pakwan/Palwan Cross Road, a major mixed-traffic junction. Footage covers 10:30–11:30 in full daylight. Road surface was wet at minute 46, suggesting recent rain. The junction carries cars, two-wheelers, auto-rickshaws, goods vehicles, buses and pedestrians continuously.

## 2. TRAFFIC AND PEOPLE
- **Cars:** dozens throughout, predominantly white, silver, grey, black and maroon; occasional red, orange, dark blue, pink/magenta, yellow.
- **Two-wheelers:** large numbers of motorcycles/scooters in every minute, most riders helmeted, many with pillions; riders in varied clothing (white, red, yellow, pink, teal, magenta, cream scooter with pink-patterned rider, etc.). One Ola-branded electric scooter (minute 7).
- **Auto-rickshaws:** green-and-yellow throughout; 4–10 visible per clip during minutes 25–49, 6–10 at any time during minutes 50–59.
- **Goods vehicles:** box vans, Tata goods carriage truck (minute 4), orange small goods truck (minute 9), white goods tempo with yellow tarpaulin (minute 14), 'SHRIGI GOODS CANVAS' truck (minute 25), 'PREMIUM EDIBLE'/'PREMIUM CABLES' canopy trucks (minutes 40–41), 'RASHI DEWAXED PREMIUM EDIBLE OILS' delivery truck, 'GOODS CARRIAGE' white van (minutes 42–45), white Tata goods truck and dark blue container truck (minute 46), "Jamnagar Transport Co." truck (minute 59), plus three-wheeler goods carriers (yellow, minute 50; orange/yellow tipper, minute 51; beige with large blue tarpaulin, minutes 52–54; blue tarpaulin truck/tempo, minute 53; white, minutes 58–59; green "PRINCE", minute 59).
- **Buses:** white Tata bus (minute 7), red city buses (minutes 9, 26, 43–45, with Gujarati LED displays), Nirma University yellow bus stationary minutes 25–27.
- **Other:** red tractor with large tanker trailer (minutes 12 and 42), red open-top off-road vehicle (minute 42), yellow JCB-type construction vehicle (minute 54, 0–5s), white pickup (minute 54), white van with roof rack (minute 55), ambulances (minute 0 white SML-type with light bar; minute 58 top-left ~5s), police vehicle with red-blue light bar (minute 49), white police/traffic van (minute 59).
- **Cyclists:** several in the first 25 minutes.
- **Pedestrians:** numerous crossings/walkers along carriageway edges throughout — man in dark clothing standing in carriageway (minute 0), man with white-and-red shopping bag crossing live traffic (minute 12, ~15–30s), woman in red patterned dress crossing between queued vehicles (minute 21, ~50s), man in blue shirt (minutes 25, 40, 41), person in white shirt (minutes 25, 36), woman in green outfit/dupatta interacting with occupants (minute 29), man in grey shirt among cars (minute 47), man with backpack, man in light blue with blue backpack, man in green shirt (minute 49), man in light blue shirt between lanes (minute 50), man in blue-and-white striped shirt (~15s) and older bald man in pink shirt and jeans (~51s) (minute 56), woman in black top and jeans with maroon backpack (~10s) (minute 57), woman in red sari top right (~20–50s) (minute 58), pink/violet-top pedestrian (~50–55s) (minute 59).

